WEBVTT

00:51:55.332 --> 00:52:00.555
to enhance their human values
and contribute to society

00:52:00.579 --> 00:52:03.193
in a way that will make us all
feel better cared for.

00:52:03.217 --> 00:52:05.907
Give an example of some
of those types of jobs.

00:52:05.931 --> 00:52:10.579
KFL: These jobs would have
a high degree of human interaction,

00:52:10.603 --> 00:52:16.936
where the AI performs the role
of the analytical engine,

00:52:16.960 --> 00:52:19.906
and then the human provides
the warmth around it.

00:52:19.930 --> 00:52:23.231
So think about the education
example we discussed.

00:52:23.255 --> 00:52:25.501
AI can grade the exams,

00:52:25.525 --> 00:52:30.752
and help do drills
and teach English pronunciation,